1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2025/03/26/75276539/1912d1b09862341c703db7f0676078bf_4973525092483124005.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2025/03/26/75276539/3f66b67667db3e73452ae6d5eceaba60_2098525429713820250.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2025/03/26/75276539/3f66b67667db3e73452ae6d5eceaba60_2098525429713820250.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e※完成玛薇卡\u003c/span\u003e传说任务「不败阳焰之章 第一幕」后体验更佳。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，会开启「荣花演武」与「龙龙寻宝」两个玩法，活动关卡会随着活动阶段逐步解锁。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 「荣花演武」中，旅行者可参与六大部族之间的攻防演武，与伙伴们并肩作战，完成各种演武中的目标，攻夺胜利与荣誉。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 「龙龙寻宝」中，旅行者需要合理规划路线，引导小龙行进，完成各个关卡的寻宝目标。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● 完成各种挑战后，可邀请\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e「深黯的谜烟·欧洛伦(雷)」\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e，还可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e原石、智识之冕\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2025/03/26/75276539/30a720c9521bf73a07ca43b8d20919f6_8873380550195751711.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.miyoushe.com/upload/2025/03/26/75276539/30a720c9521bf73a07ca43b8d20919f6_8873380550195751711.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/in